# Build products and probe output.  The probes are SOURCE artefacts: the .c files
# and the two scripts are what the measurements cite, and everything below is
# regenerable from them with ./fetch_headers.sh && ./build_probes.sh.
#
# ffnvcodec/ in particular is third-party vendor source (~900 KB) that is not
# ours to redistribute; fetch_headers.sh pins it by tag AND by commit hash, which
# is a stronger provenance claim than a copy in our tree would be.
ffnvcodec/
.hdrwork/
*.exe
*.h264
*.hevc
*.raw
*.txt
